# Testing

- Unit: `tests/unit/{domain,application,infrastructure,presentation}`
- Integration: `tests/integration/infrastructure` para transporte HTTP mock
- Application: preferir fakes dos ports
- Isolar `.env` com `SYNC_DISABLE_DOTENV=1` (`app/tests/conftest.py`)
- Cobertura branch 100% em domain/application/infrastructure/presentation
- Nao omitir CLI/`__main__` da cobertura
- Skills: `mcs-hexagonal-tdd`, `mcs-precommit`
